HOW TO RUN SERVER with verbose mode
python server.py -v
python server.py --verbose

To turn on verbose mode during runtime, input:
v
verbose

HOW TO RUN CLIENT
python client.py <playername> <deck>.csv

- deck can be omitted, but it will default to a deck.csv
i.e. python client.py <playername>

SAMPLE FOR CLIENT 
python client.py p67 deck2.csv
